251:Preferred operational artifacts:
252-- `Benchmark cohort manifest` when scenario identity and expected replay contract must be fixed before execution
253:- `Replay runner verdict sheet` when runner state, partial completion, or replay-attempted vs replay-complete distinction is the live issue
254-- `Replay suite verdict memo` when a higher-level suite verdict must summarize multiple runner-linked replay outcomes without hiding partial coverage
